OL,3,CTributes to woman killed in
OL,4,C'unspeakable manner'
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a
OL,7,F"beautiful" woman whose body was found
OL,8,Fin a Leeds tower block after a man was
OL,9,Fcharged with her murder.
OL,11,FTracy Davenport, 58, was discovered
OL,12,Ffatally injured by police in a flat in
OL,13,FCottingley Towers in the early hours
OL,14,Fof 25 July.
OL,16,FIn a statement her family said: "Tracy
OL,17,Fwould help anybody and put everybody
OL,18,Fbefore herself. She would give you her
OL,19,Flast penny. Tracy lit up any room she
OL,20,Fwalked into.
OL,26,@xD@aOU
