OL,3,CTributes to woman killed in
OL,4,C'unspeakable manner'
OL,6,F"(She was a) beautiful woman taken too
OL,7,Fsoon in the most horrific, unspeakable
OL,8,Fmanner."
OL,10,FThey added: "There are no words to
OL,11,Fdescribe the void that this tragedy
OL,12,Fhas left and can never again be
OL,13,Ffilled."
OL,15,FColin Mann, 52, of Cottingley Towers,
OL,16,Fhas been charged with murder.
OL,18,FHe refused to appear Leeds Crown Court
OL,19,Fon Wednesday and has been remanded in
OL,20,Fcustody to appear at a later date.
